    },
    "coach.innieOutie.sentence.row": {
      "comment": "Coach explanation on a Killer board, the \"rule of 45\": every ROW holds 1 through 9 and so totals 45, and the cages covering this row account for all but one square, which forces that square. %1$lld is the row number and %2$lld the digit. 45 is arithmetic, not a translatable word. Three separate sentences exist for row/column/box so each can be phrased naturally.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Zeile %1$lld summiert sich zu 45, und die Käfige darüber erfassen alle Felder bis auf eines — also ist dieses eine %2$lld."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Row %1$lld sums to 45, and the cages covering it account for every square but one — so that one is a %2$lld."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "La fila %1$lld suma 45, y las jaulas que la cubren abarcan todas las casillas menos una — así que esa es un %2$lld."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "La ligne %1$lld totalise 45, et les cages qui la couvrent comptent toutes les cases sauf une — celle-là vaut donc %2$lld."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "La riga %1$lld somma 45, e le gabbie che la coprono contano tutte le caselle tranne una — quella è quindi un %2$lld."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "第 %1$lld 行の合計は 45 で、覆っているケージは 1 マスを除くすべてを数えます。よってそのマスは %2$lld です。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "%1$lld번째 행의 합은 45이고, 이를 덮는 케이지가 한 칸만 빼고 모두 포함하므로 그 칸은 %2$lld입니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Rij %1$lld telt op tot 45, en de kooien die hem bedekken dekken alle vakjes op één na — dat ene is dus een %2$lld."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "A linha %1$lld soma 45, e as gaiolas que a cobrem abrangem todos os quadrados menos um — esse é um %2$lld."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "第 %1$lld 行的和为 45，覆盖它的笼子涵盖了除一格以外的所有格，所以那一格是 %2$lld。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "coach.nakedPair.sentence.box": {
      "comment": "Coach explanation, naked pair clearing a 3x3 BOX. %1$lld and %2$lld are the two digits, %3$lld the box number.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "%1$lld und %2$lld belegen zusammen diese beiden Felder, also kann keine von beiden woanders in Block %3$lld stehen."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "%1$lld and %2$lld fill these two squares between them, so neither can go anywhere else in box %3$lld."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "El %1$lld y el %2$lld se reparten estas dos casillas, así que ninguno puede ir a otro sitio del bloque %3$lld."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "%1$lld et %2$lld occupent à eux deux ces deux cases, donc ni l’un ni l’autre ne peut aller ailleurs dans le bloc %3$lld."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "%1$lld e %2$lld si dividono queste due caselle, quindi nessuno dei due può stare altrove nel riquadro %3$lld."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "この2マスは %1$lld と %2$lld で埋まるので、%3$lldブロックの他のマスにはどちらも入りません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "%1$lld, %2$lld 두 숫자가 이 두 칸을 나눠 채워요. 그래서 %3$lld번 박스의 다른 칸에는 두 숫자가 들어갈 수 없어요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "%1$lld en %2$lld vullen samen deze twee vakjes, dus geen van beide kan nog ergens anders in blok %3$lld."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "%1$lld e %2$lld ocupam estas duas células entre si, então nenhum dos dois cabe em outro lugar do bloco %3$lld."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "%1$lld 和 %2$lld 正好占满这两个格子，所以它们都不能出现在第 %3$lld 宫的别处。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
