          }
        }
      }
    },
    "coach.thermoBound.sentence": {
      "comment": "Coach explanation on a Thermo board: digits along a thermometer increase strictly from the round bulb end to the tip, which limits how small or large each square on it can be. %1$lld is the thermometer's length in squares. \"Floor and ceiling\" means a lowest and highest possible digit — phrase it naturally rather than literally.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Die Ziffern steigen vom Kolben zur Spitze dieses %1$lld-Feld-Thermometers, was jedem Feld darauf eine Unter- und Obergrenze gibt."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Digits rise from the bulb to the tip of this %1$lld-cell thermometer, which puts a floor and a ceiling on every square along it."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Los dígitos aumentan del bulbo a la punta de este termómetro de %1$lld casillas, lo que fija un mínimo y un máximo en cada casilla."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Les chiffres montent du bulbe à la pointe de ce thermomètre de %1$lld cases, ce qui donne un minimum et un maximum à chaque case."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Le cifre crescono dal bulbo alla punta di questo termometro da %1$lld caselle, dando a ogni casella un minimo e un massimo."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "%1$lld マスのこのサーモは球部から先端へ数字が増えるので、各マスに下限と上限がつきます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "%1$lld칸 서모는 구근에서 끝으로 숫자가 커지므로 각 칸에 최솟값과 최댓값이 정해집니다."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "De cijfers stijgen van de bol naar de punt van deze thermometer van %1$lld vakjes, wat elk vakje een onder- en bovengrens geeft."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Os dígitos aumentam do bulbo à ponta deste termômetro de %1$lld quadrados, o que dá a cada quadrado um mínimo e um máximo."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "数字沿这个 %1$lld 格温度计从球端向尖端递增，因此每一格都有下限和上限。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "coach.xWing.sentence.colBase": {
      "comment": "Coach explanation, X-wing based on two COLUMNS: in two columns the digit can only sit in the same two rows, so it is cleared from the rest of those rows. %1$lld is the digit and appears twice.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "In diesen beiden Spalten kann die %1$lld nur in zwei Zeilen stehen, also kann kein anderes Feld in diesen Zeilen eine %1$lld sein."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "In these two columns, %1$lld can only sit in two rows, so no other square in those rows can be a %1$lld."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "En estas dos columnas, el %1$lld solo cabe en dos filas, así que ninguna otra casilla de esas filas puede ser un %1$lld."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Dans ces deux colonnes, %1$lld ne peut se placer que sur deux lignes, donc aucune autre case de ces lignes ne peut être un %1$lld."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "In queste due colonne, %1$lld può stare solo in due righe, quindi nessun'altra casella di quelle righe può essere un %1$lld."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "この2つの列では %1$lld は2つの行にしか入らないので、その行の他のマスに %1$lld は入りません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "이 두 열에서 %1$lld 후보는 같은 두 행에만 있어요. 그래서 그 두 행의 나머지 칸에서는 %1$lld 후보를 지울 수 있어요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "In deze twee kolommen kan %1$lld alleen in twee rijen staan, dus geen ander vakje in die rijen kan een %1$lld zijn."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Nestas duas colunas, %1$lld só pode ficar em duas linhas, então nenhuma outra célula dessas linhas pode ser %1$lld."
