    "firstrun.beat.detail": {
      "comment": "The longer instruction in the first-launch lesson. %1$lld and %2$lld are the SAME digit, written twice — if you reorder the sentence, move both. \"Rose\" is Nine's circular digit picker.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Die Rose ist über dem leeren Feld geöffnet. Ziehe aus ihrer Mitte zur %1$lld und lass los — oder tippe einfach die %2$lld an. Mehr ist das Spiel nicht."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The rose is open on the empty cell. Drag from its middle toward the %1$lld and let go — or just tap the %2$lld. That is the whole game."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "La rosa está abierta sobre la casilla vacía. Arrastra desde el centro hacia el %1$lld y suelta, o simplemente toca el %2$lld. Ese es todo el juego."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "La rose est ouverte sur la case vide. Faites glisser depuis son centre vers le %1$lld puis lâchez — ou touchez simplement le %2$lld. C’est tout le jeu."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "La rosa è aperta sulla casella vuota. Trascina dal centro verso il numero %1$lld e rilascia — oppure tocca il numero %2$lld. Tutto il gioco è qui."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "空きマスの上にリングが開いています。中心から%1$lldの方へドラッグして離すか、%2$lldをタップします。ゲームはこれで全部です。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "빈 칸 위에 꽃이 열려 있어요. 가운데에서 %1$lld 쪽으로 끌었다가 놓아요 — 아니면 %2$lld 숫자를 바로 탭해도 돼요. 게임은 이게 전부예요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "De roos staat open op het lege vakje. Sleep vanuit het midden naar de %1$lld en laat los — of tik gewoon op de %2$lld. Dat is het hele spel."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
