    "firstrun.ledger.proof": {
      "comment": "One line of the welcome card's list. \"Proved\" is literal: the app verifies every board is solvable without guessing. A fragment, no full stop. It used to open with a count of difficulty bands and said \"Three\" while there were four, then six — copy that counts something the app can grow does not survive the app growing, so the count is gone rather than corrected.",
