      "comment": "The sentence under why.beyond.title. \"This board's level\" is its difficulty band. Declining, never apologising.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Auf der Stufe dieses Spielfelds ist dieses Feld noch nicht zu klären."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nothing at this board's level settles this square yet."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Al nivel de este tablero, esta casilla aún no queda resuelta."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Au niveau de cette grille, cette case ne se résout pas encore."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Al livello di questa griglia, questa casella non si risolve ancora."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "この盤面の難度では、このマスはまだ決まりません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "이 보드의 난이도로는 이 칸이 아직 정해지지 않아요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Op het niveau van dit bord is dit vakje nog niet te bepalen."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "No nível deste tabuleiro, esta célula ainda não se resolve."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "在这个棋盘的难度里，这个格子还定不下来。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "why.beyond.title": {
      "comment": "Heading when the coach cannot explain this square inside the board's difficulty. Two or three words.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Von hier nicht"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Not from here"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Desde aquí no"
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Pas d’ici"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Non da qui"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "ここからは導けない"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "여기서는 알 수 없음"
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Niet vanaf hier"
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Daqui não"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "从这里推不出"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "why.effect.leaves": {
      "comment": "Final line of a why-chain beat: every other candidate is gone and %1$lld is what remains. One short sentence.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Damit bleibt nur die %1$lld."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That leaves only the %1$lld."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Con eso solo queda el %1$lld."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Il ne reste que le %1$lld."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Così resta solo il %1$lld."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "残るのは %1$lld だけです。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "그래서 %1$lld 하나만 남아요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Daarmee blijft alleen de %1$lld over."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Assim sobra só o %1$lld."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "这样就只剩下 %1$lld 了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "why.effect.rulesOutMore": {
      "comment": "The same for three or more. Deliberately carries no number — past two the count stops being the point.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Damit fallen mehrere weitere Möglichkeiten für dieses Feld weg."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That clears several more possibilities from this square."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Con eso desaparecen varias posibilidades más de esta casilla."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Cela écarte plusieurs autres possibilités de cette case."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Così spariscono altre possibilità da questa casella."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "このマスから、さらにいくつかの候補が消えます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "이 칸에서 몇 가지 후보가 더 사라져요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Daarmee vallen nog meer mogelijkheden voor dit vakje weg."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Isso tira várias outras possibilidades desta célula."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "这样这个格子又少了几个可能。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "why.effect.rulesOutOne": {
      "comment": "Line under a why-chain beat when the step removed exactly one possibility, %1$lld, from the square the player asked about.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Damit fällt die %1$lld für dieses Feld weg."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That rules the %1$lld out of this square."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Con eso se descarta el %1$lld en esta casilla."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Cela écarte le %1$lld de cette case."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Così il %1$lld è escluso da questa casella."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "これでこのマスから %1$lld が消えます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "그래서 이 칸에서 %1$lld 후보가 사라져요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Daarmee valt de %1$lld voor dit vakje weg."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Isso descarta o %1$lld nesta célula."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "这样这个格子就不能是 %1$lld 了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "why.effect.rulesOutTwo": {
      "comment": "The same for exactly two possibilities, %1$lld and %2$lld. A separate entry rather than a list, so this language writes its own conjunction.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Damit fallen die %1$lld und die %2$lld für dieses Feld weg."
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "That rules the %1$lld and the %2$lld out of this square."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Con eso se descartan el %1$lld y el %2$lld en esta casilla."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Cela écarte le %1$lld et le %2$lld de cette case."
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Così il %1$lld e il %2$lld sono esclusi da questa casella."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "これでこのマスから %1$lld と %2$lld が消えます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "그래서 이 칸에서 %1$lld, %2$lld 후보가 사라져요."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Daarmee vallen de %1$lld en de %2$lld voor dit vakje weg."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "Isso descarta o %1$lld e o %2$lld nesta célula."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "needs_review",
            "value": "这样这个格子就不能是 %1$lld 或 %2$lld 了。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "why.elsewhere": {
      "comment": "Shown when the explanation skipped steps that were about other squares. Reassurance that the chain is a summary, not the whole proof. No number.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
